msgstr "Modo Altn: AUTO"

msgid ""
"# Gesture Navigation\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu\n"
"\n"
"Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints."
msgstr ""
"# Navegació per gestos\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar admet gestos tàctils al mapa:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Lliscar amunt** (U): Apropar\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Lliscar avall** (D): Allunyar\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Lliscar a la dreta** (R): Mode de pantalla anterior\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Lliscar a l'esquerra** (L): Mode de pantalla següent\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Amunt-Avall** (UD): Zoom automàtic\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Avall-Amunt** (DU): Menú\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Avall-Dreta** (DR): Detalls del punt de ruta\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Avall-Esquerra** (DL): Alternatius\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Esquerra-Amunt** (LU): Punts de ruta recents\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Dreta-Avall** (RD): Gestor de tasques\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Amunt-Dreta-Avall** (URD): Anàlisi\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Esquerra-Avall-Dreta** (LDR): Llista de comprovació\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Amunt-Dreta-Avall-Esquerra** (URDL): Mode panoràmic\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Esquerra-Avall-Dreta-Avall-Esquerra** (LDRDL): Estat\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Amunt-Esquerra-Avall-Dreta** (ULDR): Menú ràpid\n"
"\n"
"Premeu llargament el mapa per entrar al mode panoràmic. Toqueu en mode panoràmic per veure els punts de ruta propers."

msgid "Please enter four letters or digits only (ICAO station code)."
msgstr "Inserisci només quattro lettere o cifre (codice stazione ICAO)."

msgid "Updating repository"
msgstr "Actualització repository"

#, no-c-format
msgid "Signed countdown until the start gate opens or closes (now). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at the current time: Waiting (blue), Open (green), Closed (red). PEV window overrides task gate when set."
msgstr ""
"Compte enrere amb signe fins que s’obri o es tanqui la porta de sortida "
"(ara). El color del valor i la línia secundària reflecteixen l’estat de la "
"porta a l’hora actual: Esperant (blau), Oberta (verd), Tancada (vermell). La"
" finestra PEV substitueix la porta de la prova quan està definida."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Same gate as Start open. Main value is estimated time to reach the start line (MacCready leg when available, else distance / ground speed). Value colour and secondary line reflect gate state at that ETA: Too early (blue), Can start (green), Too late (red)."
msgstr ""
"Stessa gate di Start open. Il valore principale è il temps stimato per "
"raggiungere la linea di partenza (gamba MacCready si disponibile, altrimenti"
" distància / velocità suolo). Il colore del valore e la riga secondaria "
"riflettono lo stato della gate a quell'ETA: Massa d'hora (blu), Può partire "
"(verde), Massa tard (rosso)."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Home waypoint name, arrival altitude difference relative to the safety arrival height, and distance. Click to change the home waypoint."
msgstr ""
"Nome del punt de ruta Home, diferència di altitudine di arribada rispetto "
"all'altitud di arribada di seguretat e distància. Toca per cambiare il punt "
"de ruta Home."

#, no-c-format
msgid "Logger pressure altitude when the device provides it (igc_pressure_altitude), otherwise ISA pressure altitude only (1013.25 hPa; not QNH-corrected). Does not show barometric AMSL or GPS height — use other InfoBoxes for navigation."
msgstr ""
"Altitudine di pressione del logger quan il dispositiu la fornisce "
"(igc_pressure_altitude), altrimenti només altitudine di pressione ISA "
"(1013,25 hPa; non corretta QNH). Non mostra AMSL barometrico né altitud GPS "
"— usa altre InfoBox per la navigazione."

